    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 8.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe hit tyme, sylle ana ðone að, þæt he hit to ðære handa tyme, þe him sealde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who guarantees it [the security sworn to] must swear alone the oath: that he warrants that sold the cattle to the person (accuser).</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et qui aduocat, unus et solus iuret, quod ad manum illam uocet, que uendidit ei.</ab>
      </div>
